    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Crew Type (Bad Eden): Covert Ops Cell.</em></p><p><strong>“If you saw it happen, it wasn’t us.”</strong></p><p>Covert Ops cells make wars quiet. They prefer locks to speeches, shadows to banners, and results to credit. They don’t start fights—they rearrange the board so the fight never happens.</p><ul><li><strong>Tactical Identity:</strong> You gain a skill rank in Stealth and with the Tinkering aptitude.</li><li><strong>Strategic Identity:</strong> Your faction starts with +1 Intrigue OPs.</li></ul>",
